title After a goal
intro Red has the ball in front of your goal.

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-LF at 31, 34
  ball with R-LF

step
  caption Red has the ball and shoots…

step
  caption It’s in! Red scored a goal.
  ball to -3.2, 34
  arrow from R-LF to ball
  draw goal-line left
  duration 1450

question
  prompt Who gets the ball?
  answer Blue
  wrong Red
  wrong Nobody
  wrong Play on
  why After a goal, the team that got scored on gets the ball.

step
  caption You got scored on, so YOU kick off from the center.
  B-RF to 52.5, 34
  R-LF to 60.9, 34
  ball with B-RF
  label B-RF Kick-off
  draw center-circle
  banner Kick-off
